Package: MOMENT
Title: Moment-based Selection in Multivariate Linear Mixed-Effect Models
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yifan", "Chen", , "ychen300@ucsb.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: We propose a moment-based variable selection method for multivariate linear mixed-effects models. By formulating moment equations for cross-products of residuals and inducing sparsity in the covariance matrix of random effects through its diagonal, we reduce the selection problem to a set of smooth convex optimization problems solvable via proximal gradient descent.
